Developer Guide
===============

To refresh the dependencies in Eclipse, open the play console and run:

  eclipsify with-source=true

Then substitute the following in the .project file:

	<buildSpec>
		<buildCommand>
			<name>org.eclipse.jdt.core.javabuilder</name>
			<arguments>
			</arguments>
		</buildCommand>
	</buildSpec>
	<natures>
		<nature>org.eclipse.jdt.core.javanature</nature>
	</natures>
